   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">ERBIL, IRAQ - AUGUST 16: Head of Kurdish National Council (KNC) Ibrahim Biro speaks to media on PYD's attacks to parties belonging to KNC, Europe's silence on PYD's human rights violations and Kurdish people living in Syria, in Erbil, Iraq on August 16, 2016. (Photo by Yunus Keles/Anadolu Agency/Getty Images)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
