     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">12 October 2019, Hamburg: Participants of a Kurdish demonstration waving flags of the YPG (Kurdish: people's defense units) and protesting against the invasion of Turkish troops in Syrian Kurdish territories. Photo: Axel Heimken/dpa (Photo by Axel Heimken/picture alliance via Getty Images)</rdf:li>
