   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">ATHENS, GREECE - 2014/10/13: A demonstrator makes the "victory" sign standing in front of a Kurdish flag. Kurdish people that live in Athens organised a demonstration in support of the Kurdish fighters that defend the Kobani town in Iraq from ISIS insurgents. (Photo by George Panagakis/Pacific Press/LightRocket via Getty Images)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
